# Runtime data -- never commit: contains local file paths, personal training
# images, and binary model artifacts. Portability bug D17 in decisions.md
# was caused by exactly this (a committed storage/app.db baked in another
# machine's absolute paths). Treat storage/ as pure runtime state.
storage/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
